isaac-ros-cli (2.6.0-1) noble; urgency=low

  * Build Isaac ROS container images on ROS 2 Lyrical.
  * Remove the `noble` and `ros2_jazzy` image keys, deprecated since Isaac ROS 4.1, in favor of the `isaac_ros` base layer.
  * Fix `run_dev` GPU access on IGX by using CDI devices when available and otherwise selecting the NVIDIA container runtime explicitly.
  * Pin the CUDA toolkit per platform, 13.2 on x86_64 and JetPack and 13.0 on DGX Spark, instead of applying one CUDA preference to every platform.
  * Update pip shim constraints, including PyTorch 2.12 with CUDA 13.2, rosdep mappings, and Docker image definitions for Isaac ROS 5.0.

 -- Isaac ROS Maintainers <isaac-ros-maintainers@nvidia.com>  Mon, 21 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000

isaac-ros-cli (2.5.0-1) noble; urgency=low

  * Add configurable Docker image push defaults and `isaac-ros activate --push` and `--no-push` overrides.
  * Improve container access to I2C, GPIO, DRM render, and GMSL frame synchronization devices.
  * Update CUDA, TensorRT, Jetson, and DGX Spark package selection for JetPack 7.2 and Dockerless workflows.
  * Update Isaac Teleop and pyvers pip shim constraints, rosdep mappings, and Docker image definitions for Isaac ROS 4.6.

 -- Isaac ROS Maintainers <isaac-ros-maintainers@nvidia.com>  Thu, 13 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000

isaac-ros-cli (2.4.0-1) noble; urgency=low

  * Add config schema validation, command-line overrides, and the `isaac-ros status` command.
  * Improve Docker activation, `run_dev` image build lifecycle handling, and BuildKit scheduling.
  * Refresh pip shim constraints, rosdep mappings, apt repository selection, and Docker image definitions for Isaac ROS 4.5.

 -- Isaac ROS Maintainers <isaac-ros-maintainers@nvidia.com>  Mon, 6 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000

